// Current — `any` is a built-in alias for interface{} since Go 1.18
func Print(v any) { ... }
```

### Tool Dependencies in `go.mod` (Go 1.24)

Never generate a `tools.go` file with blank imports. Track dev tools with the `tool` directive:

```bash
